      "text": "Repository development practice: contributors add Tauri commands in handler/*.rs, register them in lib.rs, then run cargo tauri-typegen generate; Rust tests run via cargo test with in-memory SQLite, and CI includes a Tauri smoke test on ubuntu-24.04 with xvfb-run."
